note irequiv fixture (issue 826): population count of a ushort (u16 domain).
note pop16 counts bit by bit; pop16s is the SWAR refactor. pop16z and pop16e are
note deliberate mutants of pop16s that differ at exactly one input: the first
note (x = 0) and the last (x = 65535) of the enumeration.
fn pop16 x ushort to ushort
c = ushort 0
for i uint 16
c = add c and x 1
x = shr x 1
end
ret c
end
fn pop16s x ushort to ushort
x = sub x and shr x 1 21845
x = add and x 13107 and shr x 2 13107
x = and add x shr x 4 3855
ret and add x shr x 8 31
end
fn pop16z x ushort to ushort
if eq x 0
ret 1
end
x = sub x and shr x 1 21845
x = add and x 13107 and shr x 2 13107
x = and add x shr x 4 3855
ret and add x shr x 8 31
end
fn pop16e x ushort to ushort
if eq x 65535
ret 15
end
x = sub x and shr x 1 21845
x = add and x 13107 and shr x 2 13107
x = and add x shr x 4 3855
ret and add x shr x 8 31
end
